    <!-- How It Works -->
    <section id="how-it-works" class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">How It Works</h2>
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <ul class="steps steps-vertical lg:steps-horizontal w-full mb-12">
                <li class="step step-primary">Send Photos</li>
                <li class="step step-primary">Ship Your Part</li>
                <li class="step step-primary">We Scan</li>
                <li class="step step-primary">Approve &amp; Pay</li>
                <li class="step step-primary">Receive Files &amp; Part</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
                    <input type="radio" name="process-accordion" aria-label="1. Send Photos" checked="checked" />
                    <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">1. Send Photos</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content">
                        <p>Send photos of your part from several angles, plus a short description: approximate dimensions, material and what you want to do with the scan. We'll check it's scannable and send you a quote.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
                    <input type="radio" name="process-accordion" aria-label="2. Ship Your Part" />
                    <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">2. Ship Your Part</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content">
                        <p>If you're happy with the quote, send us your part with a return shipping label included in the package, so we can ship it back to you. Package it carefully, and we recommend insurance and tracking for valuable items.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
                    <input type="radio" name="process-accordion" aria-label="3. We Scan" />
                    <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">3. We Scan</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content">
                        <p>We scan your part within your turnaround window and email you screenshots of the scan for approval.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
                    <input type="radio" name="process-accordion" aria-label="4. Approve &amp; Pay" />
                    <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">4. Approve &amp; Pay</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content">
                        <p>Happy with the screenshots? Pay by Venmo or PayPal. You don't pay anything until you've seen the scan.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
                    <input type="radio" name="process-accordion" aria-label="5. Receive Files &amp; Part" />
                    <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">5. Receive Files &amp; Part</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content">
                        <p>We send you the scan files (STL and PLY formats), then ship your original part back using your label.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>